      "id": "text-9",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Real Trees Planted",
        "body": "**How does it work?**\n\n‍\n\nWhenever you buy suns, coins or other items in the game with real money, this creates revenue. Jungle Heroes donates a portion of this revenue to certified organisations that restore ecosystems in the real world. Jungle Heroes aims to plant as many trees as possible. Jungle Heroes’ current tree planting efforts are focused in the regions of Indonesia and Madagascar.",
        "link": {
          "label": "Learn more about the reforestation efforts.",
          "href": "https://www.studiobirthplace.com/work/jungleheroes-howdoesitwork"
        }
      },
      "padTop": "4-5",
